  "description": "AsNet.Shared is a foundational .NET library that provides shared and reusable\ncross-cutting components such as standardized result models for data, business\nand HTTP layers, auditing contracts, DTOs, cryptography helpers, image utilities,\n.NET language extensions and common infrastructure helpers.",
